### GET all items
GET http://localhost:5184/catalog

### GET item by id
GET http://localhost:5184/catalog/1

### GET an id that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5184/catalog/99

### POST a new item
POST http://localhost:5184/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shoes",
  "description": "Running Shoes",
  "brand": "Nike",
  "price": 109.99
}

### POST a rating to item 1
POST http://localhost:5184/catalog/1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stars": 5,
  "userName": "dmmal",
  "review": "Great shirt"
}